  "worked_solution": "We know that $\\text{rank}(C)$ is the number of pivot columns in $C.$ \n\nSince $C$ has $6$ columns and $4$ of them are non-pivots, then the number of pivot columns in $C$ is \n\n$$\n6-4=2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{rank}(C)=2.$",
